#: data/io.github.mowi12.SwayThings.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Sway Things gives the sway Wayland compositor the familiar shape of a "
"desktop settings app: a searchable sidebar of pages, controls that apply "
"instantly, and a safety net for risky changes."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.mowi12.SwayThings.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"It never edits your hand-written config. It writes sway config files of its "
"own, which your config includes with a single line. Changes apply live, and "
"the same settings are available on the command line with sway-things."
msgstr ""
